Package: moose
Type: Package
Title: Tools to Reshape and Manipulate Dichotomous Keys Used in Taxonomic
    Identification
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jeremy", "Leipzig", , "leipzig@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7224-9620"))
Description: Transforms between dichotomous identification keys and a
    variety of phenotype formats, including feature matrices and polyclave
    (multi-access) keys, and generates interactive dichotomous key wizards.
    Imports keys from 'FishBase' <https://www.fishbase.se/keys/allkeys.php>
    and includes PhyloTree Build 17, the human mitochondrial DNA phylogeny
    (van Oven 2015, <doi:10.1016/j.fsigss.2015.09.155>), as distributed by
    'Haplogrep' 3.
License: GPL
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the PhyloTree data.
URL: https://github.com/leipzig/moose
